          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 18 2024 18:07:50 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #af6d04;\">Sizing options based in SOMA</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Sizing options based on real patient anatomies from Prophecy &amp; SOMA databases.&nbsp;Available sizing ranges designed to cover most patient anatomies.</span></span></p>\n",
