          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 27 2025 15:02:03 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Indicated for use with our comprehensive Ankle Fusion portfolio.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The Ankle Truss System is indicated for use with the T2 Ankle Arthrodesis Nail or the Valor Hindfoot Fusion Nail as part of a tibiotalocalcaneal fusion construct in a salvage procedure.</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Apr 07 2025 20:45:30 GMT+0000",
